Let me see your Pokédex for a moment.{VAR BE01}
What do we have here?{VAR BE01}
So, you've found {VAR 0202 0000} Pokémon, eh?{VAR BE01}

Hmmm...
You haven't seen a Klink yet, eh?{VAR BE01}
Still, that's a great Pokédex!{VAR BE01}

Excuse me! I was a little excited
and forgot my manners.{VAR BE01}
My name is Juniper, too! Cedric Juniper.{VAR BE01}
Heh! The professor who gave you
the Pokédex is my daughter!{VAR BE01}
That girl has told me a lot about you.{VAR BE01}
It really makes my day to meet you!{VAR BE01}

Cedric: Some Pokémon can change forms
even when it's the same individual.{VAR BE01}
If you have already seen a form, you
can check it with this whenever you want.{VAR BE01}
I also added a function to make
searching easier.{VAR BE01}

Cedric: Oh! I forgot my introductions!
Skyla, this is a friend of my daughter's.{VAR BE01}
{VAR 0100 0000} is traveling around
Unova to complete the Pokédex.{VAR BE01}

Skyla: Oh, I see! So that means you'll
be challenging the Gym!{VAR BE00}
Oh boy! I'm really looking forward to it!{VAR BE01}

Cedric: That's right, {VAR 0100 0000}.
You should challenge this Gym!{VAR BE01}
If nothing else, this Gym
is really out there!{VAR BE01}

Skyla: Professor, my plane
is a cargo plane!{VAR BE01}
It carries cargo, not people!{VAR BE01}
And you're talking as if places like Kanto
and Sinnoh are right around the corner!{VAR BE01}

Cedric: Aww, Skyla.
If you keep frowning, your face might{VAR BE00}
freeze like that, and that'd be a shame.{VAR BE01}
People and Pokémon, we all have
to help each other out!{VAR BE01}
See you later!{VAR BE01}

Skyla: Sheesh!{VAR BE01}
It's hard to believe a happy-go-lucky
guy like that could be a world-renowned{VAR BE00}
Pokémon professor.{VAR BE01}

Heads-up, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
As a Gym Leader, I'd be happy to have
you challenge the Gym, but there's{VAR BE00}
something I need to take care of first.{VAR BE01}

Heads-up, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}
As a Gym Leader, I'd be happy to have
you challenge the Gym, but there's{VAR BE00}
something I need to take care of first.{VAR BE01}

Just now, as I was flying the
cargo plane, I saw something{VAR BE00}
on top of the Celestial Tower.{VAR BE01}

I'm sure that it is a sick Pokémon!
If it is, I can't just leave it there!{VAR BE01}
I have to look into this right away.{VAR BE01}
I'm leaving for Route 7's Celestial Tower.
You can come along if you want.{VAR BE01}

Skyla completed her cargo-plane run.
She must have gone somewhere after.{VAR BE01}
Maybe to the Celestial Tower on Route 7?

N: {VAR BE09 0001}They may say it is for understanding
one another better, but what Trainers{VAR BE00}
really use battles for is to compete...{VAR BE00}
And they hurt each other's Pokémon!{VAR BE01}
Am I the only one who finds this
terribly painful?{VAR BE01}
Whatever...
I'm going to talk to your Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
I've been living with Pokémon
since I was born, so it's easier for{VAR BE00}
me to talk with them than with people.{VAR BE01}
...Because Pokémon never tell lies.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}Hey, {VAR 0101 0000}.{VAR BE01}
Would you tell me what kind of Trainer
{VAR 0100 0001} is?{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}OK, OK, got it.{VAR BE01}
So {VAR 0100 0001} was born in Nuvema Town,
lives with Mom, and was given the Pokédex{VAR BE00}
to start off a journey to see the world.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}Still, this {VAR 0101 0001} trusts you
for some reason. That's good!{VAR BE01}
If every person and Pokémon cared about
one another like you two do,{VAR BE00}
I could watch over the future of people{VAR BE00}
and Pokémon without having to liberate{VAR BE00}
Pokémon from people who just use them.{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}Ghetsis is using Team Plasma
to search for some special stones--{VAR BE01}
the Light Stone and the Dark Stone...{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}These stones hold the essence of two
legendary Pokémon. It is said that when{VAR BE00}
they lost their physical form, they fell{VAR BE00}
into a slumber and were transformed.{VAR BE01}
Now, they wait for the hero's arrival...{VAR BE01}
I shall resurrect a legendary
Dragon-type Pokémon from one of{VAR BE00}
these stones, and become its friend.{VAR BE01}
That will show the world that
I am the new hero.{VAR BE00}
Everyone will follow what I say!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}My vision is to change the world
without using force.{VAR BE01}
Trying to change the world by force
will just make others resist.{VAR BE01}
If people resist, the ones that will be
hurt are the innocent Pokémon{VAR BE00}
used by foolish Trainers.{VAR BE01}
You understand.{VAR BE01}
Pokémon are not just tools
for people to use!{VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

{VAR BE09 0001}As a result...{VAR BE01}
Pokémon and Trainers who care about
one another, like you and your Pokémon,{VAR BE00}
will be separated.{VAR BE00}
And that does break my heart a little. {VAR BE09 0000}{VAR BE01}

Pokémon and people worked together
to open up desolate land and make{VAR BE00}
a place where everyone could live.{VAR BE01}
I'm certain that this cooperative
spirit will remain unchanged.

It's dangerous to play in a landing strip,
but you should be OK on ours.{VAR BE01}
We only have one cargo flight a day.

If you want to eat delicious vegetables,
the ones grown in the wild are the best.{VAR BE01}
As the weather and the seasons change,
wild vegetables get more and more tasty.{VAR BE01}
Even Pokémon like to eat wild vegetables!

Vegetables grown in a greenhouse
are the best.{VAR BE01}
The temperature and their nutrients
are all managed systematically.{VAR BE01}
Vegetables grown in a completely
efficient way taste extra delicious!

